; The SSA projection suite for one backend: the source-direct and bridge SSA
; programs, projected to the Loop IR and run by this backend's executor, against
; the reference. The case table is test/ssa_projection/projection.ml, copied
; rather than forked, so every backend is asked the same questions.

(copy_files %{workspace_root}/test/ssa_projection/projection.ml)

; Needs node, so it runs under `make wasm.runtest` (which sets MLTORCH_WASM), not
